      "alt": "SiTime clock generators",
      "text": "<h3><b>Flexible, Multi-Output MEMS Clock Generators</b></h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">SiTime’s programmable MEMS clock generators support wide frequency synthesis and superior jitter performance across multiple outputs. Perfect for high-speed FPGA, SoC, and ASIC applications, these devices simplify clock tree design with unmatched programmability.</p>",
